  "signal_basis": {
    "component_id": "C013.signal_basis",
    "value": "Account-level event inspection, customer follow-up and feasible setup observation produce successive batches of evidence for and against competing explanations. An explicit evidence table records these findings, distinguishing discriminating patterns from ambiguous funnel traces.",
    "scope": "Qualitative updating within observed customer types and follow-up, constrained by evidence quality, missing offline activity and dependent observations. Deprioritization requires reasonable sensitivity to the explanation's predicted effect.",
